WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.414
Lex-plus-powers.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.032
Fix a regular sequence: the lex-plus-powers ideal should realize every Hilbert function.

3
00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:10.563
And it should also have the largest Betti numbers.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.324
Claimed: both conjectures, over every field of characteristic zero.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.680
Manuscript only, not in Lean.
